  "zone": "blackstrand",
  "level": 12,
  "body": "sulphur_toad",
  "place": "squats in the warmest pool south of the harbour; its back is one great yellow blister",
  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). A toad as big as a cart, with one blister on its back the size of a barrel. Its tongue drags whoever it hits back to its mouth, and it hops onto the tank. At half health the blister bursts: a sulphur bubble rides every player (spread out) and the spill leaves yellow slicks that poison.",
  "party": {
    "solo": "Solo-able at 12 if you keep out of the slicks.",
    "small": "Right for 2-3.",
    "full": "Easy.",
    "m5": "M5 adds health per extra player and one more copy of the spread/scatter shapes for parties of 4-5; mechanics stay the same."
  },
  "hpMult": 2,
  "arena": {
    "radius": 24
  },
  "say": {
    "pull": [
      "The pool steams. Two yellow eyes come up, then a great deal of toad.",
      "Old Blister croaks. The water shivers."
    ],
    "death": "Old Blister deflates with a long, sad wheeze.",
    "reset": "Old Blister sinks back into its warm pool."
  },
